#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:5
msgid "class Flash -- access to built-in flash storage"
msgstr "kelas Flash -- akses ke penyimpanan flash bawaan"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :class:`Flash` class provides direct, block-level access to the RP2040's"
" external QSPI flash chip. The driver implements the "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` interface so it can be passed to "
":func:`vfs.mount` for custom filesystem configurations."
msgstr ""
"Kelas :class:`Flash` menyediakan akses langsung setingkat blok ke chip flash"
" QSPI eksternal RP2040. Driver ini mengimplementasikan antarmuka "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` sehingga dapat diteruskan ke :func:`vfs.mount`"
" untuk konfigurasi filesystem khusus."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:12
msgid ""
"Most scripts persist data through the auto-mounted filesystem at ``/`` and "
"never construct :class:`Flash` directly. Construct one manually when you "
"need to:"
msgstr ""
"Sebagian besar skrip menyimpan data melalui filesystem yang dipasang "
"otomatis di ``/`` dan tidak pernah membuat :class:`Flash` secara langsung. "
"Buat satu secara manual ketika Anda perlu:"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:16
msgid ""
"Mount a non-default filesystem (e.g. wrap with :class:`vfs.VfsFat`) on a "
"custom partition."
msgstr ""
"Memasang filesystem non-default (misalnya bungkus dengan "
":class:`vfs.VfsFat`\\ ) pada partisi khusus."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:18
msgid ""
"Read or write firmware regions or factory-data blocks that aren't owned by "
"the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Membaca atau menulis wilayah firmware atau blok data pabrik yang tidak "
"dimiliki oleh filesystem."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:20
msgid ""
"Implement a custom on-flash storage format that bypasses the filesystem "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Mengimplementasikan format penyimpanan di-flash khusus yang melewati lapisan"
" filesystem."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:24
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktor"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:28
msgid ""
"Return the singleton :class:`Flash` block-device object backed by the "
"RP2040's QSPI flash chip. The first block exposed is the one immediately "
"after the firmware region, so callers see only the filesystem-eligible area "
"of the chip."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan objek block-device :class:`Flash` singleton yang didukung oleh"
" chip flash QSPI RP2040. Blok pertama yang diekspos adalah blok tepat "
"setelah wilayah firmware, sehingga pemanggil hanya melihat area chip yang "
"memenuhi syarat untuk filesystem."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:34
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:39
msgid ""
"Read bytes from the flash into ``buf``. Standard "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` block-device entry point used by the "
"filesystem layer."
msgstr ""
"Membaca byte dari flash ke dalam ``buf``\\ . Titik masuk block-device "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` standar yang digunakan oleh lapisan "
"filesystem."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf)``): read whole blocks starting"
" at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of the flash "
"block size."
msgstr ""
"**Bentuk sederhana** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): membaca seluruh"
" blok mulai dari indeks blok ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` harus merupakan "
"kelipatan dari ukuran blok flash."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): read "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. Used by littlefs and other "
"byte-addressable filesystems."
msgstr ""
"**Bentuk diperluas** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): membaca"
" ``len(buf)`` byte -- tidak harus merupakan jumlah blok bulat -- mulai dari "
"byte ``offset`` di dalam blok ``block_num``\\ . Digunakan oleh littlefs dan "
"filesystem yang dapat dialamatkan byte lainnya."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:56
msgid ""
"Write bytes from ``buf`` to the flash. Standard "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` block-device entry point used by the "
"filesystem layer."
msgstr ""
"Menulis byte dari ``buf`` ke flash. Titik masuk block-device "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` standar yang digunakan oleh lapisan "
"filesystem."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``): write whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the flash block size. Each affected block is erased automatically before "
"being written."
msgstr ""
"**Bentuk sederhana** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): menulis "
"seluruh blok mulai dari indeks blok ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` harus "
"merupakan kelipatan dari ukuran blok flash. Setiap blok yang terpengaruh "
"dihapus secara otomatis sebelum ditulis."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): write "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. **No implicit erase** is "
"performed -- the caller must ensure the affected blocks have been erased via"
" a prior ``ioctl(6, block_num)`` call."
msgstr ""
"**Bentuk diperluas** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): "
"menulis ``len(buf)`` byte -- tidak harus merupakan jumlah blok bulat -- "
"mulai dari byte ``offset`` di dalam blok ``block_num``\\ . **Tidak ada "
"penghapusan implisit** yang dilakukan -- pemanggil harus memastikan blok "
"yang terpengaruh telah dihapus melalui panggilan ``ioctl(6, block_num)`` "
"sebelumnya."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:75
msgid ""
"Standard :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` control entry point. Called by the "
"filesystem layer at mount/unmount time and on every sync. Recognised ``cmd``"
" values:"
msgstr ""
"Titik masuk kontrol :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` standar. Dipanggil oleh "
"lapisan filesystem pada waktu pasang/lepas dan pada setiap sinkronisasi. "
"Nilai ``cmd`` yang dikenali:"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:79
msgid "``1`` -- initialise. Returns ``0`` on success."
msgstr "``1`` -- inisialisasi. Mengembalikan ``0`` jika berhasil."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:80
msgid "``2`` -- deinitialise. Returns ``0`` on success."
msgstr "``2`` -- deinisialisasi. Mengembalikan ``0`` jika berhasil."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:81
msgid "``3`` -- sync pending writes. Returns ``0``."
msgstr "``3`` -- sinkronkan penulisan yang tertunda. Mengembalikan ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:82
msgid "``4`` -- return the number of flash blocks visible to the filesystem."
msgstr "``4`` -- kembalikan jumlah blok flash yang terlihat oleh filesystem."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:84
msgid ""
"``5`` -- return the block size in bytes (typically the flash sector size, "
"``4096``)."
msgstr ""
"``5`` -- kembalikan ukuran blok dalam byte (biasanya ukuran sektor flash, "
"``4096``\\ )."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:86
msgid ""
"``6`` -- erase the block at index ``arg``. Required before using the "
"extended ``writeblocks`` form."
msgstr ""
"``6`` -- hapus blok pada indeks ``arg``\\ . Diperlukan sebelum menggunakan "
"bentuk ``writeblocks`` yang diperluas."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:88
msgid ""
"``7`` -- return whether the device supports the block erase command (``1`` "
"on RP2040)."
msgstr ""
"``7`` -- kembalikan apakah perangkat mendukung perintah penghapusan blok (\\"
" ``1`` pada RP2040)."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:91
msgid ""
"Direct callers normally don't use this method -- the filesystem driver "
"dispatches the standard codes automatically once the :class:`Flash` is "
"mounted."
msgstr ""
"Pemanggil langsung biasanya tidak menggunakan metode ini -- driver "
"filesystem mengirimkan kode standar secara otomatis setelah :class:`Flash` "
"dipasang."
